# local web preview
#
# The app is an iOS client; these exist only so it can be bundled for a desktop
# browser to look at screens. metro.config.js swaps the native-only modules
# (SecureStore, VLC, Cast) for web-shims/ stand-ins, and app.config.js turns off
# the static prerender that those shims cannot survive. None of it is used by
# the iOS build, and none of it should shape what ships.
metro.config.js
app.config.js
web-shims/
